  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7df911688ca425f8f129e9c77e6df6e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: A letter, left on the hall table
  Body: 'Hunter,


    You came, as I hoped. The Morvayne Collection is closed to
    the public after dark, but I have left the doors open for you.


    Eleven people
    have gone missing in the valley since spring. The constable says they ran off.
    You and I know better.


    Begin in the Grand Gallery, and look closely at
    the exhibits. I assure you that every piece is authentic.


    - The Curator'
  ReadClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d827ef23d1b788f4b92b1131a21aa803, type: 3}
  Verb: Read
